# Live co-creation study (DriveClear)

Full context: `LIVE-STUDY-CONTEXT.md` — read when prompt includes `@LIVE-STUDY-CONTEXT.md` or live study fields.

## Role

Designer prompts during a live session. Participant sees prototype updates on refresh. Do not suggest facilitator questions.

## Default prompt shape

```
They said: "..."
Update prototype: ...
Show on: [page]
Constraints: match DriveClear, fake data, no backend, fast
```

## Build discipline

- One visible idea per update; smallest diff that matches what they said
- Reuse `css/styles.css` classes; teal/navy DriveClear look
- Static HTML first; no backend/APIs/real credit checks
- Fake data only; assigned credit tiers (great 4.9%, good 6.9%, fair 9.9%, poor ~12%+)

## Inventory check (automatic — mandatory)

Whenever **`js/profile.js`** is edited (participant intent, homepage picks, market, appointment):

1. **Hook runs automatically** — `.cursor/hooks/check-inventory-after-profile.sh` executes `node scripts/check-inventory.mjs`
2. **Agent MUST include** the hook's PASS/FAIL + SRP count in the reply — never skip or bury it
3. **If FAIL** — fix profile or inventory links before telling the facilitator to refresh; do not hand off a broken SRP

Do not ask the facilitator to verify inventory manually unless the hook passed but they report a browser mismatch.

## AI UI options (pick one)

1. VDP in-flow: `#pa-popover` / `initPaymentAssistant()` in `js/app.js`
2. Global chat: uncomment Lens widget in page HTML
3. Static insight card near relevant number (fastest)

## Pages by journey stage

- Prepared → index, srp, financing
- Reassured → vdp (+ payment calc, history)
- In control → sell-trade, financing, static dealer/trade panels
- Satisfied → simple static section if needed

## After each change

State: what changed, URL to refresh (`localhost:8000/...`), one sentence on what to show the participant.

**If `js/profile.js` changed:** inventory check results (PASS/FAIL + SRP count) are required in the same reply — injected automatically by hook.
